+/**
+ * The Daily Grind - Cryptographic Signing & Verification Engine
+ * Supports Classical (ECDSA P-256, RSA-PSS 2048) and Quantum-Resistant (W-OTS+ Hash-Based) Asymmetric Keys.
+ * Runs in both modern Browser (Web Crypto API) and Node.js environments.
+ */
+
